00:12:41.949 --> 00:12:44.533
diversifying what you're
doing in your business.

00:12:44.533 --> 00:12:47.098
So how to have diversity in thought

00:12:47.098 --> 00:12:48.396
when becoming a music artist?

00:12:48.396 --> 00:12:49.820
What do you think?

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.443
- Such a cool question.

00:12:51.443 --> 00:12:52.343
Where was I yesterday.

