00:13:39.142 --> 00:13:43.503
but I would say, if your
business is around music is

00:13:43.503 --> 00:13:46.480
there's so many different types.

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:48.650
Again, what I encourage is,
you go where the market is,

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:53.453
go where the audience is,
or create the audience.

00:13:53.453 --> 00:13:58.361
Just spare time, Spotify,
listen in to all this stuff.

00:13:58.361 --> 00:14:00.862
In terms of music, there
is so much diversity.

00:14:00.862 --> 00:14:02.445
It's a joy in this.

00:14:03.758 --> 00:14:05.187
It's absolutely rich.

00:14:05.187 --> 00:14:08.639
Therefore, it depends on what
