very good on execution.

00:32:33.970 --> 00:32:36.105
Some people are very good on social media.

00:32:36.105 --> 00:32:38.822
Some people are really awesome
around sales and marketing.

00:32:38.822 --> 00:32:41.551
Some people are really awesome
on product development.

00:32:41.551 --> 00:32:44.258
The more you do that in
terms of diversity of skills

00:32:44.258 --> 00:32:47.038
and competency, and
capability, the more successful

00:32:47.038 --> 00:32:50.671
you'll be as a business
as you scale up and grow.

