00:33:38.594 --> 00:33:39.834
- It's a great question, Kathy.

00:33:39.834 --> 00:33:44.615
I think the reality would be
if you live in a cosmopolitan

00:33:44.615 --> 00:33:47.555
city like Toronto or
New York or near a city,

00:33:47.555 --> 00:33:51.188
