00:48:41.722 --> 00:48:43.819
I think is really important.

00:48:43.819 --> 00:48:46.330
- Hey, it's interesting, and
as a real example actually,

00:48:46.330 --> 00:48:49.278
where we talked about the
customer in the room a lot

00:48:49.278 --> 00:48:51.765
