There's a brand in the
UK called Ted Baker,

00:48:56.531 --> 00:48:59.642
a fashion brand, clothing brand.

00:48:59.642 --> 00:49:02.090
Ted is a fictional character

00:49:02.090 --> 00:49:03.884
