around you in the room

00:49:32.507 --> 00:49:35.189
to deliver value for that customer.

00:49:35.189 --> 00:49:37.091
When you do that, you
do that consistently,

00:49:37.091 --> 00:49:39.759
and you scale that, you've
got a fantastic business.

00:49:39.759 --> 00:49:42.831
So I think it's pretty special.

00:49:42.831 --> 00:49:44.088
- I love it, what would Ted do?

00:49:44.088 --> 00:49:45.257
I like it.

00:49:45.257 --> 00:49:46.255
Cool well--

00:49:46.255 --> 00:49:47.146
